onic-clonic movements and muscular jerks</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="ipej030239-02"/></fig><table-wrap id="T1" position="float"><label>Table 1</label><caption><p>Type of positive response during the tilt-table test</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="ipej030239-03"/></table-wrap><table-wrap id="T2" position="float"><label>Table 2</label><caption><p>Classification of positive responses to tilt testing</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="ipej030239-04"/></table-wrap></floats-group></article>